WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Seatbelt basics
demo lesson, about 60 seconds

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
1. Fasten the seatbelt
before you start the engine

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
2. Keep it fastened while the engine runs
even when you are waiting

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
3. Never unbuckle to lean out
while the machine can move

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
4. If the machine tips:
stay in the seat, hold on, brace

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
5. Report a damaged belt
before you operate
